<DESCRIPTION>PRESS RELEASE BY TNL MEDIAGENE DATED DECEMBER 5, 2025
<TEXT>
<HTML>
<HEAD>
     <TITLE></TITLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">

<P STYLE="text-align: right; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>Exhibit 99.1</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 24pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">TNL
Mediagene Announces Results of 2025 Annual General Meeting of Shareholders</FONT></P>



<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">TOKYO and TAIPEI, December 5, 2025 -- TNL Mediagene (Nasdaq: TNMG)
(the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;), a Tokyo-based next-generation digital media and data group in Asia, today announced that it held its Annual
General Meeting of Shareholders (&ldquo;2025 AGM&rdquo;) on December 2, 2025, which was originally held on November 25, 2025 and adjourned
to December 2, 2025. Each of the proposals submitted to the shareholders for approval at the 2025 AGM has been approved.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Specifically, the shareholders of the Company passed and approved the
following proposals:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">Proposal No. 1: by ordinary resolution, the authorised share capital
is increased from $50,000 (500 million ordinary shares) to $500,000 (5 billion ordinary shares).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">Proposal No. 2: by special resolution, the amended and restated memorandum
and articles of association of the Company, reflecting the increased authorised share capital under Proposal No. 1 and certain governance
enhancements, is approved and adopted.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">Proposal No. 3: by ordinary resolution, Marcus Brauchli and Priscilla
Han are elected as Class I Director and Class II Director, respectively, in accordance with the classified board provisions of the amended
and restated memorandum and articles of association under Proposal No. 2.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Proposal No. 4: by ordinary resolution, a share consolidation (reverse
share split) at a ratio in the range of 1-for-2 to 1-for-100, is approved and the Board of Directors is authorized to implement such share
consolidation at the discretion of the Board of Directors within twelve months of 2025 AGM.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Proposal No. 5: by special resolution, a further amended and restated
memorandum and articles of association, to be effective only if the Board of Directors elects to implement the share consolidation under
Proposal No. 4, is approved and adopted.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">Proposal No. 6: by ordinary resolution, the Board of Directors is authorized
to issue up to 500 million ordinary shares (on a pre-consolidation basis) over the next twelve months of 2025 AGM, subject to adjustment
if the share consolidation under Proposal No. 4 is implemented.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0">Proposal No. 7: by ordinary resolution, the Chairperson of 2025 AGM
is authorized to adjourn the meeting if necessary or appropriate.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

